OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with further outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain and hill snow, but turning
OL,9,Fgenerally lighter and more patchy as
OL,10,Fwinds ease overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA few showers at first.
OL,13,FOtherwise it will be a dry, cold and
OL,14,Frather cloudy day.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,17,FThursday and Friday will be chilly
OL,18,Fwith bright spells and a few showers.
OL,19,FDry but chilly on Saturday with bright
OL,20,For sunny spells. Overnight frosts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
